doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24339819
title: "GPRadar-API: GPR hyperbola detection service"
abstract: >-
  FastAPI web service that runs the GPRadar processing chain and a YOLO11n ONNX detector on ground-penetrating radar B-scans and returns hyperbola detections with apex positions and approximate depths.
